---
title: Vanilla Gingerbread Latte
description: Easy homemade Vanilla Gingerbread Latte...the sweetest mug to cozy up to...perfect for sipping on while watching your favorite holiday movie!
image: https://www.halfbakedharvest.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/Vanilla-Gingerbread-Latte-1.jpg
cook time: 15 minutes
nutrition:
  calories: 1203 kcal
  serving size: 1 serving
time required: 30 minutes
source: https://www.halfbakedharvest.com/vanilla-gingerbread-latte/
prep time: 15 minutes
servings: 2
---

Combine @milk{2%cups}, @maple syrup{2%tbsp}, @molasses{1%tbsp}, @ginger{1%tsp}, @cinnamon{1/2%tsp}, and a pinch of @salt{} in a #medium pot{} and bring to a simmer, heat until steaming. Add @vanilla extract{1%tbsp}. Using a #whisk or fork, whisk until frothy. Remove from the heat.

Divide @espresso{4%shots} between 2 mugs. Pour over the gingerbread milk. Top with @?whipped cream{} for serving and a sprinkle of @./Café/Salted Caramel Brûlée{}.
